name: Voidstream Hyperlane
description: Opens a stable channel through the cosmic void, instantly transporting liquids across immense distances.
type: LiquidBridge
category: liquid
size: 1

range: 50
liquidCapacity: 300
liquidPressure: 1.2
health: 50
armor: 1
floating: true
arrowPeriod: 0.9
arrowTimeScl: 2.75
